ce","r":"management","s":"Mario Marte","x":"We are also reiterating our outlook for full year 2022 adjusted EBITDA margin to be between breakeven and 1%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/06/02/chewy-inc-chwy-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2022 Q2","e":"chwy","d":"2022-08-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Mario Marte","x":"As we move into Q3, we expect the positive price cost delta that we saw in Q2 to narrow as some costs catch up to the price increases that we saw in the second quarter, providing less of a gross margin tailwind in the back half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/30/chewy-inc-chwy-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2022 Q2","e":"chwy","d":"2022-08-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jian Li","x":"Can you just like expand on two-way pricing -- true strategy for the pricing pass-through?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/30/chewy-inc-chwy-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2022 Q2","e":"chwy","d":"2022-08-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mario Marte","x":"We are raising our outlook for full year 2022 adjusted EBITDA margin to 1.75% to 2%, up from our prior range of breakeven to 1%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/30/chewy-inc-chwy-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2022 Q3","e":"chwy","d":"2022-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"Number two, we are expecting incremental costs, as we've shared in the previous calls, we're expecting incremental cost and therefore, more inflation to be passed through into the industry as we enter 2023.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/12/09/chewy-chwy-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2022 Q3","e":"chwy","d":"2022-12-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"But then again, as we get more information, we will definitely pass that on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/12/09/chewy-chwy-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2022 Q3","e":"chwy","d":"2022-12-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Fitzgerald","x":"Any update or how should we frame up the cost savings that you realized from that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/12/09/chewy-chwy-q3-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q1","e":"chwy","d":"2023-05-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mario Marte","x":"And we obviously have just raised our full year guidance given everything we know.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/05/31/chewy-chwy-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q2","e":"chwy","d":"2023-08-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"This behavior is driven by a more fluid macro environment, including high levels of inflation, which have been passed through the industry over the past 18 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/30/chewy-chwy-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q2","e":"chwy","d":"2023-08-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"While we saw a modest benefit from price increases, efforts such as growing Chewy health ecosystem, increasing uptake of our Autoship program, and our large customer base that spends more with us over time have driven the majority of our NSPAC expansion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/30/chewy-chwy-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q2","e":"chwy","d":"2023-08-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"But on the back of that, I want to reiterate the guidance that we provided, which we actually feel pretty good about, given the strength that we're seeing from ordering customers and the engagement, you know, from those customers on our platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/30/chewy-chwy-q2-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q3","e":"chwy","d":"2023-12-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"You might see a little bit of pricing benefit getting into Q1 based on kind of how the cost price increases came in through '22, '23, but you will not see any impact or any benefit of pricing as we move out of our Q1 quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/12/06/chewy-chwy-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q3","e":"chwy","d":"2023-12-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"The difference in '06 versus -- 2006 to '08 versus now is that the level of inflations that are passed through the system have been unprecedented.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/12/06/chewy-chwy-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q3","e":"chwy","d":"2023-12-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"In light of our Investor Day next week, we will streamline today's call to focus on this quarter's results and a few notable recent updates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/12/06/chewy-chwy-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q3","e":"chwy","d":"2023-12-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"In November, as part of our 2024 strategic planning process, we implemented actions to reduce our headcount in certain areas of the organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/12/06/chewy-chwy-q3-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q4","e":"chwy","d":"2024-03-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"This includes our B2C e-commerce platform for products such as core and veterinary diet, food, pharmacy and supplements; our emerging B2C services such as telehealth and insurance; as well as our B2B solutions for veterinary practitioners to streamline their operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/03/20/chewy-chwy-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2023 Q4","e":"chwy","d":"2024-03-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"SG&A in the quarter included approximately 14 million of severance-related expenses associated with the corporate restructuring actions taken in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/03/20/chewy-chwy-q4-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2024 Q1","e":"chwy","d":"2024-05-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"All of that, the work that we've been working through sort of the last three, four years is starting to culminate and then there are these newer green shoots, such as sponsored ads, which are now starting to compound the yield that you're seeing pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/29/chewy-chwy-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2024 Q2","e":"chwy","d":"2024-08-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Rupesh Parikh","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/28/chewy-chwy-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2024 Q3","e":"chwy","d":"2024-12-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"With respect to the tariff question that you mentioned, you know, we have a very small reliance and presence on China specifically.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/04/chewy-chwy-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2024 Q3","e":"chwy","d":"2024-12-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"So, our reliance on the region in our -- the impact of any potential tariff is relatively low on Chewy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/12/04/chewy-chwy-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2024 Q4","e":"chwy","d":"2025-03-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Reeder","x":"And finally, embedded in our guidance is minimal expected impact from tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/03/26/chewy-chwy-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2025 Q4","e":"chwy","d":"2026-03-25","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"David Bellinger","x":"You had the Chewy+ investments in the back half, also the Get Real launch, some front-loaded SG&A costs ahead of the tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/02/chewy-chwy-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2025 Q4","e":"chwy","d":"2026-03-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"Functions such as customer service, fulfillment pharmacy and marketing operations are leveraging internally developed AI tools to streamline workflows and improve productivity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/02/chewy-chwy-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2026 Q1","e":"chwy","d":"2026-06-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"Over the last several quarters, we have continued to build the foundational infrastructure required to deploy AI broadly across the enterprise.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/10/chewy-chwy-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2026 Q1","e":"chwy","d":"2026-06-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Chris Deppe","x":"We are expanding earnings materially faster than revenue growth while continuing to invest behind strategic initiatives, including Chewy Health, Chewy Vet Care, AI infrastructure and fulfillment network optimization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/10/chewy-chwy-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHWY 2026 Q1","e":"chwy","d":"2026-06-10","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Sumit Singh","x":"Furthermore, we believe our strategic initiatives across health, AI, fulfillment and customer experience continue to strengthen the moat around the Chewy ecosystem.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/06/10/chewy-chwy-q1-2